{"content": "1|/* Twinthos v3 — ivory system. One file owns tokens + base. */
2|@font-face{font-family:"Inter Tight";src:url(/assets/fonts/InterTight-normal-400-700.woff2) format("woff2");font-weight:400 700;font-style:normal;font-display:swap}
